	(text "REQ-CC-06 asks for homing from the API OR an external button, so J901 parallels\nboth on-board switches for a panel button.  R905/R906 limit the contact current\nand set the debounce with C901/C902 - about 1 ms rise, 10 us fall.  Which of\nBTN_1 / BTN_2 is HOME is OQ-05: firmware and silkscreen only, the two channels\nare electrically identical."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.7800 132.0800 0)
		(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(justify left top)
			)
		(uuid "e2c19890-19c7-5cbf-ab5d-4772c949b26b")
	)
